      "writtenOn": "2022-09-20T18:03:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The caller provides integer value, to avoid ubsan we should change the type of shm.transfer to enum. But, this patch may not be the right place to do it.\n\nYes, we could have used __print_symbolic if we were to only print the enum. However, we are required to pass the enum value converted to string to the Perfetto UI, since that doesn\u0027t have access to the enum field names.\nAlso, __print_symbolic requires update whenever there is modification to the enum, which is the same limitation that the current code poses. So, I leave it unchanged",
      "parentUuid": "49bdb3f5_db01b2f6",
      "revId": "b653a72d5b22ac3e36a183293317939c40bb9012",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
